// A black warlock in a butterfly jar - OSRS's obj 10014, on the jar model the Rellekka round brought in
// from OSRS (19406, here obj_snowy_knight; its glacialis twin is the same bytes) with the black warlock's
// own recolour, HSL 39892 -> 652, as RGB15. Release, in the cache's slot, gives the jar back and, as in
// OSRS, boosts Strength by 4 + 15% (scripts/hunter_warlock.rs2).
[black_warlock]
name=Black warlock
desc=There's a black warlock butterfly in here.
model=obj_snowy_knight
2dzoom=590
2dxan=280
2dyan=1756
2dxof=9
2dyof=60
recol1s=10879
recol1d=5153
weight=20g
cost=70
members=yes
iop4=Release
